<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80964" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περαίνω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			10.28
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Philol.
			1
		</span></i>, etc.; poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πειραίνω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Arat.
			24
		</span></i> : also impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπείραινε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					8(7).25
				</span></i>
			 : fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περᾰνῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					563
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				672e
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ανέω</span>,
				3sg.-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εῖ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Hat.Puer.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Meliss.
				5
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέρᾱνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				207c
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			
			aor.
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πειρήνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					48
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, pres., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.43
			</span></i> : fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περᾰνοῦμαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια</span>-) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				53c
			</span></i> : aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερᾱνάμην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι</span>-) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				26
